<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech HN-Wood index falls one point to 1,567 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech HN-Wood index falls one point to 1,567 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The HN-Wood index, measuring the 60 most capitalised issues on the Prague Stock Exchange, fell one point, or 0.06 percent, on Monday to 1,567, the brokerage house Wood &amp; Company said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
